        "text": "Which claim correctly names the places?",
        "marks": 1,
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "Call $5.307$ a whole-number label only, and stop naming places."
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "$5$ is ones; $3$ is tenths; $0$ is hundredths; $7$ is thousandths, with the decimal point separating whole-number places from fractional places."
